# The shipped extension repository.
#
# This is a SEPARATE git repository, nested inside the user's SillyTavern
# checkout on purpose: SillyTavern's own `.git` makes the install a nested repo
# boundary, so the outer repository physically cannot track any file in here.
# Keeping our history separate also means the user's ST history is never
# polluted by our commits. See REPORT.md, "decisions made where GOAL.md was silent".

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Never commit a key. The shipped extension has no key and must never read
# secret.md; see GOAL.md 9.2.
*.key
secret.md